      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そこは水の守り人の力だからね。\r\n簡単に真似できるようなものじゃないのさ。",
        "official_en": "That’s the power of the Wardens of the Waters! It’s not something that can be easily replicated.",
        "real_en": "That’s the power of the Wardens of Water. It isn’t easy to reproduce."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
